### Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Rationale |
|----------|-------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | 5 min | False-pass risk — bugs hide silently |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | 10 min | Hidden gap — one branch never tested |
| 3 | Mystery Guest | 5 min | Guaranteed CI failure |
| 4 | Sleepy Test | 15 min | 2 s slowdown + flakiness |
| 5 | Exception Handling | 5 min | Quick one-liner swap to `ThrowsException<T>` |
| 6 | Assertion Roulette | 5 min | Add message strings |
| 7 | Eager Test | 15 min | Split or mark as integration |
| 8 | Magic Number Test | 10 min | Readability improvement |
| 9 | Sensitive Equality | 10 min | Reduce brittleness |
| 10 | General Fixture | 2 min | Remove unused `_logger` field |

